= System Requirements <engine:nelson_system_requirement>

System Requirements by platforms.

== Description

#strong[Linux];:

 #strong[Operating system];: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, Ubuntu 22.04 LTS, Ubuntu 20.04 LTS, Fedora, ArchLinux, NixOs

 #strong[Processor];: Any Intel or AMD x86-64 processor.

 #strong[RAM];: See Operating System Requirements (16 GB recommended or more).

 #strong[Storage];: 1 GB for all products installation and an SSD\/nvme is recommended.

 #strong[Graphics];: A hardware-accelerated GPU with OpenGL support and at least 1GB of memory is recommended.

 

 #strong[Windows];:

 #strong[Operating system];: Windows 10, 11 or Windows Server 2022.

 #strong[Processor];: Any Intel or AMD x86-64 processor with AVX2 instructions set (CPU released from 2015 onwards).

 #strong[RAM];: See Operating System Requirements (16 GB recommended or more).

 #strong[Storage];: 1 GB for all products installation and an SSD\/nvme is recommended.

 #strong[Graphics];: A hardware-accelerated GPU with OpenGL support and at least 1GB of memory is recommended.

 

 #strong[MacOs];:

 #strong[Operating system];: macOS Tahoe, macOS Sequoia, macOS Sonoma, macOS Ventura.

 #strong[Processor];: Any Intel processor support by Apple and any M-series chip.

 #strong[Storage];: 1 GB for all products installation and an SSD\/nvme is recommended.

 #strong[Graphics];: Any Mac capable of running macOS Ventura has a GPU that can run Nelson.

 


